; Script opcode $85: print a numbered string
;
; Operand: n (1 byte), a string number of the table at $9048 (0-52: room names, parchment texts, ...). Printed by #R$9F30 at the text row ($9F26) and the alignment set by $82.
; .
; Hardware: draws on the screen bitmap (through #R$9E79).
;
; HL Operand byte
; O:HL Address after the operand
@label=OpPrintString
c$9DAF LD A,(HL)     ;
 $9DB0 INC HL        ;
 $9DB1 PUSH HL       ;
 $9DB2 CALL $9F30    ;
 $9DB5 POP HL        ;
 $9DB6 RET           ;
